      "id": "source-1",
      "title": "Guide overview and learning objectives",
      "kind": "prose",
      "paragraphs": [
        "This ordinary differential equations guide contains 8 worked examples across 7 pages. Its learning objectives are to understand what an ordinary differential equation is; identify order and degree and distinguish linear from nonlinear equations; solve basic first-order ODEs using separation of variables and integrating factors; recognize and solve simple second-order linear homogeneous equations; and interpret initial conditions and apply them to obtain particular solutions."
      ],
      "steps": [],
